<title>JAPAN: Japan one-month CD rate rises to 0.61 pct - bankers.</title>
<headline>Japan one-month CD rate rises to 0.61 pct - bankers.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-03-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>One-month certificates of deposit (CDs) traded at 0.61 percent in Tokyo on Wednesday, the highest since March 18, 1996, bankers said.</p>
<p>One-month CDs had last been traded on March 3 at 0.55 percent.</p>
